 * The js/ root zip path a DEFERRED require resolves against — the pack's
 * js/ module root is the ONLY base the runtime uses for post-init requires
 * (gh-823). './x.js' → 'js/x.js'; '../x.js' climbs OUT of js/ (the runtime
